{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Farm!</h2>In this world, you can grow various crops, mine for ores, fish, and craft, among other things.<br>Train your skills in different areas: agriculture, fishing, combat, crafting, and alchemy. Upgrade your skills and unlock new abilities!<br>You can also have various bizarre creatures help you build your farm!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat in Dungeons</h2>Take the various items you've crafted on the farm into the dungeons, defeat monsters to obtain materials and rare items!<br>In the dungeons, you will encounter various monsters, and sometimes you'll come across some powerful enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Worlds</h2>There are various places in this world. Plant crops on the farm, mine in the caves, fish by the river, and fight in dungeons.<br>Meet different characters and develop relationships with them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/328732650d0f003af1b6cef44ca6c158.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/328732650d0f003af1b6cef44ca6c158.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2161950?t=1772171313","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2161950?t=1772171313","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/032407590068b0228fc8c62ffbfd043f3cdce518/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772171313","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/032407590068b0228fc8c62ffbfd043f3cdce518/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772171313","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>A Message from the Creator</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development has been underway for some time, with a projected <strong>launch in 2026</strong> (pending smooth progress).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am the <strong>sole developer</strong> behind this project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can contact me via the following platforms. Your feedback and inquiries are always welcome, and I will strive to respond to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Farm!</h2>In this world, you can grow various crops, mine for ores, fish, and craft, among other things.<br>Train your skills in different areas: agriculture, fishing, combat, crafting, and alchemy. Upgrade your skills and unlock new abilities!<br>You can also have various bizarre creatures help you build your farm!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=414 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/298a0ba68680acc1552948bea1f9d92a.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/b2e2558d3267a98265f573bee7b14c2b.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combat in Dungeons</h2>Take the various items you've crafted on the farm into the dungeons, defeat monsters to obtain materials and rare items!<br>In the dungeons, you will encounter various monsters, and sometimes you'll come across some powerful enemies!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" width=616 height=344 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/f6b5c74daa6f4087e80bfabffd2b90cd.mp4?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore New Worlds</h2>There are various places in this world. Plant crops on the farm, mine in the caves, fish by the river, and fight in dungeons.<br>Meet different characters and develop relationships with them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/328732650d0f003af1b6cef44ca6c158.poster.avif?t=1772171313\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/extras/328732650d0f003af1b6cef44ca6c158.webm?t=1772171313\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>","developers":["AKIHA0416"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2161950/header.jpg?t=1772171313","is_fr